      "spam": false,
      "value": "Nice idea,\n\nI think the way it might be able to be done, would be having a world have that feature built into the world, through some SDK code that could be added to a world, that will attempt to play audio and have animations played.  Alternatively, have an alternate netcode that a player can set on themselves.\n\nHowever I feel this will be quite a difficult thing to implement.  It  could either cause audio or animations to stutter more, should someone have latency issues.  Ideally having the avatar stutter would be better than having the audio.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
